# UX workflow: atomic Project Modulator destination and Macro creation.
# Purpose: proves one legal + Macro row, audible reversible preview, direct
# Depth edit, learned Apply/Back grammar, and one Undo/Redo for Macro + edge.
# Expect: capture_changed:empty_registry=source_kind_picker, capture_changed:source_kind_picker=destination_picker, capture_changed:destination_picker=add_macro_focused, capture_changed:add_macro_focused=macro_destination_preview
# Expect: capture_changed:macro_destination_preview=preview_depth_edited, capture_changed:preview_depth_edited=preview_cancelled, capture_changed:preview_cancelled=destination_applied
# Expect: capture_changed:destination_applied=creation_undone, capture_changed:creation_undone=creation_redone
# Expect: semantic:macro_destination_preview:effect=start_lfo_destination_audition, semantic:macro_destination_preview:projection=audible_audition
# Expect: semantic:preview_depth_edited:effect=edit_destination_audition_depth, semantic:preview_cancelled:effect=cancel_destination_audition
# Expect: semantic:destination_applied:effect=apply_destination_audition, semantic:destination_applied:outcome=applied

0 scenario project-modulator-destination
80 capture screen project_overview

# Learned Project tab shortcut reaches the empty Project-owned registry.
180 button LEFT_CENTER down
780 encoder NAV 1
860 encoder NAV 2
940 encoder NAV 3
1020 encoder NAV 4
1100 encoder NAV 5
1180 button LEFT_CENTER up
1400 capture screen empty_registry

# Add Source first asks what will be created. LFO stays the first, learned
# choice; selecting it opens the existing destination grammar.
1520 tap NAV 60
1740 capture screen source_kind_picker
1860 tap NAV 60
2080 capture screen destination_picker
2200 encoder NAV 1
2420 capture screen add_macro_focused

# NAV publishes an audible provisional Macro + source + assignment. OPT edits
# only the pending edge; Back restores the exact empty state and stays local.
2540 tap NAV 60
2780 capture screen macro_destination_preview
2900 encoder OPT 0.80
3120 capture screen preview_depth_edited
3240 tap LEFT_TOP 60
3480 capture screen preview_cancelled

# Repeat and Apply with the same learned bottom-right grammar.
3600 tap NAV 60
3840 tap BOTTOM_RIGHT 60
4080 capture screen destination_applied

# The complete creation is one history action. Undo returns to a usable empty
# registry; Redo restores the source and Macro while retaining registry focus.
4200 button LEFT_CENTER down
4800 tap LEFT_TOP 60
5020 button LEFT_CENTER up
5260 capture screen creation_undone
5380 button LEFT_CENTER down
5980 tap LEFT_BOTTOM 60
6200 button LEFT_CENTER up
6440 capture screen creation_redone
